{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo and full game players can play together!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The game doesn't have matchmaking or single-player campaign, and should be played with friends.</i></strong><br><i>However, there is the option to create and potentially join public lobbies from the community.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ghosts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ghost spawns at each player's location at set intervals.<br>Use them to get a hint of where other players might be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/dd39537958b8941a7a7a3337403a1876.poster.avif?t=1770980333\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/dd39537958b8941a7a7a3337403a1876.webm?t=1770980333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/dd39537958b8941a7a7a3337403a1876.mp4?t=1770980333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Revealing players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different equipment to reveal other players, each working differently.<br>Choose the right one for the right situation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/75067747cf7476cd242b06dc177da11c.poster.avif?t=1770980333\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/75067747cf7476cd242b06dc177da11c.webm?t=1770980333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/75067747cf7476cd242b06dc177da11c.mp4?t=1770980333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features 4 different game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture</strong>: Collect, protect and steal gems to earn points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch</strong>: Be the first to reach the target kill count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb Defusal</strong>:\u00a0Attackers plant, defenders defuse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elimination</strong>: Play as a team to eliminate the opposing team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/76e8906ce13e3d7e984b58e56ecbebf7.poster.avif?t=1770980333\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/76e8906ce13e3d7e984b58e56ecbebf7.webm?t=1770980333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/76e8906ce13e3d7e984b58e56ecbebf7.mp4?t=1770980333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game configs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game mode can be configured individually to make every match feel unique.<br>Combine different settings to make the game your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.poster.avif?t=1770980333\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.webm?t=1770980333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/0fa0bf8cfc6d47e6f57f6ab8c7407454.mp4?t=1770980333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883690/a6ff08dc5f0fb4acab576ebd869bf66d51b88521.jpg"},{"name":"Gotcha!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883690/35a13264a7bea37914a3853e3f2df79864ef84c1.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883690/03987180ef6dd66a800aa281af6ad41bbf9e9217.jpg"},{"name":"Electrocuted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883690/1104d33230fc62b4e0be1872e654bde9668bd3df.jpg"},{"name":"Grand magus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883690/9dd31988bafbd60d152e0c73ec086b4fb6d03633.jpg"},{"name":"No more hiding!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883690/15a6a7f30f59aa30f15c7a5657d3926af58de028.jpg"},{"name":"Spot on","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883690/02d8ca4963213c614f81db2b412499b72445271b.jpg"},{"name":"That's not how it works...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883690/34e712d515130dd5a180aad6b6ef8e36dc167e50.jpg"},{"name":"I'm watching you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883690/a2b4d2941d99d053c7d6b50c75f0df18d6cc3c84.jpg"},{"name":"You're on fire!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883690/2a8ce09072c39e893153122f0e6966756865a3c2.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2883690?t=1770980333","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690